(gen_random_uuid()::text,'mz','en_MZ','hcm-admin-schemas','USERWITHBOUNDARY_README_HEADER_1_DESC_2','Open the excel template that was downloaded in the previous step will have 3 sheets and the first sheet you will see is a “Read Me” sheet. The second Sheet named “Create List of Users“ that will be an empty sheet where the user needs to enter data to create users for the campaign. The third sheet will be named “List of Campaign Boundaries“ which will have all the boundaries selected in the “Boundary Details“ step with their respective boundary codes.',1,now(),1,now()),
